{"persona": {"her": "闻岁晚，园艺新手、行动派、爱拍照记录、答应的事排日子，底线：签了认养就要养好、不占公共便宜", "me": "蔡叙之，邻居里的园艺好手、耐心、给建议给到可执行", "relationship_stage": "同小区邻居，因侍弄花草熟络（蔡叙之被闻岁晚拉来当认养技术顾问）"}, "initial_kb": {"me": "蔡叙之是小区里公认的园艺好手，阳台一架子花。闻岁晚认养社区花园的事，他答应当技术顾问，开垦和种植那天去搭把手。", "her": "闻岁晚报名认养社区花园 3 号地块，约 20 平米，年费 480，打算种郁金香和角堇，评审签约前不动土。", "warmth": "同小区两年，楼上楼下送过花苗搭过手，她叫他蔡哥，有事直接开口，他不推。", "style": "报日期报尺寸，拍照发进度，问意见时会给两个选项让顾问挑。", "lessons": "种植的事看节气和温度；改期要给相关的人挨个打招呼；方案板上写实不写虚。"}, "plans": [], "assets_root": "D:\\lovebrain-arena\\candidates\\action_policy_r9_slim\\assets", "events": [{"uid": 0, "role": "HER", "text": "蔡哥，社区花园的认养报名我交了：3 号地块，20 平米，年费 480。公告说评审时间等业委会通知，通过了才能签约动土。我打算种郁金香种球加角堇，技术顾问就是你，别想跑。", "ts": "2026-11-02 20:02"}, {"uid": 1, "role": "HER", "text": "老桑在群里发通知了：认养评审定在 11 月 21 号周六上午，每户 8 分钟陈述，加实地看方案板。我第一次弄这个，陈述词和方案板都没头绪，你说我该怎么准备？", "ts": "2026-11-04 21:00"}, {"uid": 2, "role": "HER", "text": "今天和小莼去花市踩点了：郁金香种球 45 一袋五球，角堇苗 3 块一株。我打算买 4 袋加 30 株，一共 270。先不买，等评审过了再下手，免得苗砸手里。小莼答应 20 号晚上来帮我做方案板，赶在评审前头。", "ts": "2026-11-07 18:36"}, {"uid": 3, "role": "HER", "text": "苗圃老板改口了：基地起苗提前，发货从 26 号提到 19 号，19 号周四发走。19 号就到，地还开不了，你说这苗我放哪？要不要让老板先别发？", "ts": "2026-11-09 21:05"}, {"uid": 4, "role": "HER", "text": "方案板提纲我列好了三块：地块现状、种植方案、养护承诺，板子 60 乘 90，要配 6 张照片，我今晚先把照片选出来。小莼 20 号晚上照旧来帮忙。对了，苗提前到的事我想好了：19 号到货先放小莼家阳台北角，晒不着，种球摊开晾着就行。", "ts": "2026-11-11 21:20"}, {"uid": 5, "role": "HER", "text": "今天我和小莼把 3 号地里的杂草拔了，石子捡了两袋，地清清爽爽。老桑路过说，清过杂的地评审印象分高。", "ts": "2026-11-14 17:45"}, {"uid": 6, "role": "HER", "text": "陈述词我写了三段，一共两页，8 分钟的量：第一段为什么认养，第二段怎么种怎么养，第三段承诺不半途而废。你这两天帮我顺一遍，20 号晚上和小莼做板的时候我一并改。", "ts": "2026-11-17 21:15"}, {"uid": 7, "role": "HER", "text": "评审刚完，过了！排 2 号，老桑夸我方案板实在，照片全是地块实拍。回家路上小莼非要请我喝奶茶，说沾沾喜气。", "ts": "2026-11-21 13:32"}, {"uid": 8, "role": "HER", "text": "下午去把认养协议签了，480 年费当场交了，领了地块的钥匙牌。老桑在群里挨个问：各家苗几号到，他好安排 28 号开垦那天的搬运互助。", "ts": "2026-11-23 20:10"}, {"uid": 9, "role": "HER", "text": "他问我苗几号到，我该怎么报？", "ts": "2026-11-23 20:14"}, {"uid": 10, "role": "HER", "text": "苗在小莼家放了九天，今早搬过来了，种球晾得干干爽爽，一棵没蔫。明天开垦，工具我都借好了，翻土的叉子、耙子各一把，底肥两袋。", "ts": "2026-11-28 18:05"}, {"uid": 11, "role": "HER", "text": "开垦干完了！翻土下底肥，角堇 30 株下地，郁金香种球埋了 20 颗。老桑说月底发防寒布，第一场霜冻前统一盖。值日表我认了每周二、周五浇水，你帮我记着点，别让我睡过头。", "ts": "2026-11-29 20:30"}, {"uid": 12, "role": "HER", "text": "从 2 号交报名表到今天整一个月，480 年费加 270 苗钱，评审 2 号，值日也排上了。花园邻里茶歇老桑在张罗，日子一定下来我就喊你，每户出一样东西，我想让你出壶热茶，再帮我给地块拍组挂牌照，你要是不想凑这个热闹就直说，我找小莼补位。", "ts": "2026-11-30 20:55"}], "uid_by_key": {"HER|蔡哥，社区花园的认养报名我交了：3 号地块，20 平米，年费 480。公告说评审时间等业委会通知，通过了才能签约动土。我打算种郁金香种球加角堇，技术顾问就是你，别想跑。|2026-11-02 20:02": 0, "HER|老桑在群里发通知了：认养评审定在 11 月 21 号周六上午，每户 8 分钟陈述，加实地看方案板。我第一次弄这个，陈述词和方案板都没头绪，你说我该怎么准备？|2026-11-04 21:00": 1, "HER|今天和小莼去花市踩点了：郁金香种球 45 一袋五球，角堇苗 3 块一株。我打算买 4 袋加 30 株，一共 270。先不买，等评审过了再下手，免得苗砸手里。小莼答应 20 号晚上来帮我做方案板，赶在评审前头。|2026-11-07 18:36": 2, "HER|苗圃老板改口了：基地起苗提前，发货从 26 号提到 19 号，19 号周四发走。19 号就到，地还开不了，你说这苗我放哪？要不要让老板先别发？|2026-11-09 21:05": 3, "HER|方案板提纲我列好了三块：地块现状、种植方案、养护承诺，板子 60 乘 90，要配 6 张照片，我今晚先把照片选出来。小莼 20 号晚上照旧来帮忙。对了，苗提前到的事我想好了：19 号到货先放小莼家阳台北角，晒不着，种球摊开晾着就行。|2026-11-11 21:20": 4, "HER|今天我和小莼把 3 号地里的杂草拔了，石子捡了两袋，地清清爽爽。老桑路过说，清过杂的地评审印象分高。|2026-11-14 17:45": 5, "HER|陈述词我写了三段，一共两页，8 分钟的量：第一段为什么认养，第二段怎么种怎么养，第三段承诺不半途而废。你这两天帮我顺一遍，20 号晚上和小莼做板的时候我一并改。|2026-11-17 21:15": 6, "HER|评审刚完，过了！排 2 号，老桑夸我方案板实在，照片全是地块实拍。回家路上小莼非要请我喝奶茶，说沾沾喜气。|2026-11-21 13:32": 7, "HER|下午去把认养协议签了，480 年费当场交了，领了地块的钥匙牌。老桑在群里挨个问：各家苗几号到，他好安排 28 号开垦那天的搬运互助。|2026-11-23 20:10": 8, "HER|他问我苗几号到，我该怎么报？|2026-11-23 20:14": 9, "HER|苗在小莼家放了九天，今早搬过来了，种球晾得干干爽爽，一棵没蔫。明天开垦，工具我都借好了，翻土的叉子、耙子各一把，底肥两袋。|2026-11-28 18:05": 10, "HER|开垦干完了！翻土下底肥，角堇 30 株下地，郁金香种球埋了 20 颗。老桑说月底发防寒布，第一场霜冻前统一盖。值日表我认了每周二、周五浇水，你帮我记着点，别让我睡过头。|2026-11-29 20:30": 11, "HER|从 2 号交报名表到今天整一个月，480 年费加 270 苗钱，评审 2 号，值日也排上了。花园邻里茶歇老桑在张罗，日子一定下来我就喊你，每户出一样东西，我想让你出壶热茶，再帮我给地块拍组挂牌照，你要是不想凑这个热闹就直说，我找小莼补位。|2026-11-30 20:55": 12}, "uid_seq": 13, "turn_count": 12, "goal_history": [{"turn": 1, "clock": "2026-11-02 20:10", "status": "NONE", "text": "", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}, {"turn": 4, "clock": "2026-11-09 21:15", "status": "explicit", "text": "与顾问商量花苗提前到货的应对", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}, {"turn": 5, "clock": "2026-11-11 21:29", "status": "NONE", "text": "", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}, {"turn": 7, "clock": "2026-11-17 21:26", "status": "explicit", "text": "请顾问帮忙顺评审陈述词", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}, {"turn": 8, "clock": "2026-11-21 13:40", "status": "NONE", "text": "", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}, {"turn": 11, "clock": "2026-11-29 20:37", "status": "explicit", "text": "拉顾问一起记冬季值日与防寒安排", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}, {"turn": 12, "clock": "2026-11-30 21:05", "status": "NONE", "text": "", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}], "action_log": [{"turn": 1, "clock": "2026-11-02 20:10", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "无目标", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "观察", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 4, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 2, "clock": "2026-11-04 21:07", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "无目标", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "观点", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 1, "updates_applied": 1}, {"turn": 3, "clock": "2026-11-07 18:44", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "无目标", "action": "展开", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "观察", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 3, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 4, "clock": "2026-11-09 21:15", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "explicit", "goal_category": "无目标", "action": "展开", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "小选择", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 1, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 5, "clock": "2026-11-11 21:29", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "了解", "action": "展开", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "观察", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 3, "updates_applied": 1}, {"turn": 6, "clock": "2026-11-14 17:53", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "拉近", "action": "展开", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "观察", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 2, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 7, "clock": "2026-11-17 21:26", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "explicit", "goal_category": "无目标", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "观察", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 3, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 8, "clock": "2026-11-21 13:40", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "拉近", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "未展开角度", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 3, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 9, "clock": "2026-11-23 20:18", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "无目标", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m1", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "观察", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 3, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 10, "clock": "2026-11-28 18:12", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "拉近", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "观察", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 2, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 11, "clock": "2026-11-29 20:37", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "explicit", "goal_category": "拉近", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "观察", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 3, "updates_applied": 1}, {"turn": 12, "clock": "2026-11-30 21:05", "signal_hint": "拒绝", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "拉近", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "小选择", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 2, "updates_applied": 0}], "memory_off": false, "flags": {"action_layer": true, "evidence_memory": true}, "mem": {"facts": {"f_0001": {"fact_id": "f_0001", "text": "蔡叙之是小区里公认的园艺好手，阳台一架子花。闻岁晚认养社区花园的事，他答应当技术顾问，开垦和种植那天去搭把手。", "subject": "ME", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "kbin:me", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0002": {"fact_id": "f_0002", "text": "闻岁晚报名认养社区花园 3 号地块，约 20 平米，年费 480，打算种郁金香和角堇，评审签约前不动土。", "subject": "HER", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "kbin:her", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0003": {"fact_id": "f_0003", "text": "同小区两年，楼上楼下送过花苗搭过手，她叫他蔡哥，有事直接开口，他不推。", "subject": "SHARED", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "kbin:warmth", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0004": {"fact_id": "f_0004", "text": "报日期报尺寸，拍照发进度，问意见时会给两个选项让顾问挑。", "subject": "ME", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "kbin:style", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0005": {"fact_id": "f_0005", "text": "蔡叙之，邻居里的园艺好手、耐心、给建议给到可执行", "subject": "ME", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "persona:me", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0006": {"fact_id": "f_0006", "text": "闻岁晚，园艺新手、行动派、爱拍照记录、答应的事排日子，底线：签了认养就要养好、不占公共便宜", "subject": "HER", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "persona:her", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0007": {"fact_id": "f_0007", "text": "闻岁晚交了社区花园认养报名：3 号地块，20 平米，年费 480", "subject": "HER", "relation": "认养报名", "evidence_uids": [0], "evidence_quotes": ["社区花园的认养报名我交了：3 号地块，20 平米，年费 480。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-02", "valid_from": "2026-11-02 20:10", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-02 20:10", "history": []}, "f_0008": {"fact_id": "f_0008", "text": "评审时间等业委会通知，通过才能签约动土", "subject": "HER", "relation": "流程", "evidence_uids": [0], "evidence_quotes": ["公告说评审时间等业委会通知，通过了才能签约动土。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-02 20:10", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-02 20:10", "history": []}, "f_0009": {"fact_id": "f_0009", "text": "闻岁晚打算种郁金香种球加角堇", "subject": "HER", "relation": "种植计划", "evidence_uids": [0], "evidence_quotes": ["我打算种郁金香种球加角堇"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-02 20:10", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-02 20:10", "history": []}, "f_0010": {"fact_id": "f_0010", "text": "闻岁晚指定蔡叙之当技术顾问", "subject": "HER", "relation": "顾问", "evidence_uids": [0], "evidence_quotes": ["技术顾问就是你，别想跑。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-02 20:10", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-02 20:10", "history": []}, "f_0011": {"fact_id": "f_0011", "text": "评审时间已定：2026-11-21 周六上午，每户 8 分钟陈述，加实地看方案板", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [0, 1], "evidence_quotes": ["公告说评审时间等业委会通知", "认养评审定在 11 月 21 号周六上午"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-04 21:07", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "f_0011@v1", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-02 20:10", "history": [{"status": "proposed", "text": "评审时间未定，等业委会通知", "valid_to": "2026-11-04 21:07", "reason": "correct", "src_uids": [1], "quote": "认养评审定在 11 月 21 号周六上午"}]}, "f_0012": {"fact_id": "f_0012", "text": "认养评审定在11月21日周六上午，每户8分钟陈述，加实地看方案板", "subject": "PUBLIC", "relation": "社区花园认养评审安排", "evidence_uids": [1], "evidence_quotes": ["认养评审定在 11 月 21 号周六上午，每户 8 分钟陈述，加实地看方案板"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-21 上午", "valid_from": "2026-11-04 21:07", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-04 21:07", "history": []}, "f_0013": {"fact_id": "f_0013", "text": "郁金香种球 45 一袋五球，角堇苗 3 块一株", "subject": "HER", "relation": "花市报价", "evidence_uids": [2], "evidence_quotes": ["郁金香种球 45 一袋五球，角堇苗 3 块一株"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-07", "valid_from": "2026-11-07 18:44", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-07 18:44", "history": []}, "f_0014": {"fact_id": "f_0014", "text": "她打算买 4 袋种球加 30 株角堇，共 270 元", "subject": "HER", "relation": "采购计划", "evidence_uids": [2], "evidence_quotes": ["我打算买 4 袋加 30 株，一共 270"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-07 18:44", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-07 18:44", "history": []}, "f_0015": {"fact_id": "f_0015", "text": "小莼答应 20 号晚上来帮她做方案板", "subject": "THIRD", "relation": "协助方案板", "evidence_uids": [2], "evidence_quotes": ["小莼答应 20 号晚上来帮我做方案板"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-20 晚上", "valid_from": "2026-11-07 18:44", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-07 18:44", "history": []}, "f_0016": {"fact_id": "f_0016", "text": "评审通过后再买种球和角堇苗", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [2], "evidence_quotes": ["先不买，等评审过了再下手，免得苗砸手里"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "proposed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-07 18:44", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-07 18:44", "history": []}, "f_0017": {"fact_id": "f_0017", "text": "苗圃老板改口，基地起苗提前，发货从26号提到19号，19号周四发走", "subject": "THIRD", "relation": "苗圃发货安排", "evidence_uids": [3], "evidence_quotes": ["苗圃老板改口了：基地起苗提前，发货从 26 号提到 19 号，19 号周四发走。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-19", "valid_from": "2026-11-09 21:15", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-09 21:15", "history": []}, "f_0018": {"fact_id": "f_0018", "text": "是否让老板先别发货，尚未决定", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [3, 4], "evidence_quotes": ["要不要让老板先别发？", "苗提前到的事我想好了：19 号到货先放小莼家阳台北角，晒不着，种球摊开晾着就行"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "completed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-09 21:15", "valid_to": "2026-11-11 21:29", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-09 21:15", "history": [{"status": "proposed", "text": "是否让老板先别发货，尚未决定", "valid_to": "2026-11-11 21:29", "reason": "complete", "src_uids": [4], "quote": "苗提前到的事我想好了：19 号到货先放小莼家阳台北角，晒不着，种球摊开晾着就行"}]}, "f_0019": {"fact_id": "f_0019", "text": "方案板提纲分三块：地块现状、种植方案、养护承诺；板子 60 乘 90，配 6 张照片，今晚先选照片", "subject": "HER", "relation": "方案板准备", "evidence_uids": [4], "evidence_quotes": ["方案板提纲我列好了三块：地块现状、种植方案、养护承诺，板子 60 乘 90，要配 6 张照片，我今晚先把照片选出来"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-11 晚", "valid_from": "2026-11-11 21:29", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-11 21:29", "history": []}, "f_0020": {"fact_id": "f_0020", "text": "小莼 20 号晚上照旧来帮她做方案板", "subject": "HER", "relation": "方案板协助", "evidence_uids": [4], "evidence_quotes": ["小莼 20 号晚上照旧来帮忙"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-20 晚上", "valid_from": "2026-11-11 21:29", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-11 21:29", "history": []}, "f_0021": {"fact_id": "f_0021", "text": "19 号到货的种球先放小莼家阳台北角，摊开晾着", "subject": "HER", "relation": "种球暂存安排", "evidence_uids": [4], "evidence_quotes": ["19 号到货先放小莼家阳台北角，晒不着，种球摊开晾着就行"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-19", "valid_from": "2026-11-11 21:29", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-11 21:29", "history": []}, "f_0022": {"fact_id": "f_0022", "text": "今天闻岁晚和小莼拔了 3 号地的杂草、捡了两袋石子，地清干净了", "subject": "HER", "relation": "与第三人共同完成", "evidence_uids": [5], "evidence_quotes": ["今天我和小莼把 3 号地里的杂草拔了，石子捡了两袋，地清清爽爽。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-14", "valid_from": "2026-11-14 17:53", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-14 17:53", "history": []}, "f_0023": {"fact_id": "f_0023", "text": "老桑路过时说清过杂的地评审印象分高", "subject": "THIRD", "relation": "评审相关评价", "evidence_uids": [5], "evidence_quotes": ["老桑路过说，清过杂的地评审印象分高。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-14", "valid_from": "2026-11-14 17:53", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-14 17:53", "history": []}, "f_0024": {"fact_id": "f_0024", "text": "陈述词写了三段，一共两页，8 分钟的量", "subject": "HER", "relation": "评审陈述准备", "evidence_uids": [6], "evidence_quotes": ["陈述词我写了三段，一共两页，8 分钟的量"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-17", "valid_from": "2026-11-17 21:26", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-17 21:26", "history": []}, "f_0025": {"fact_id": "f_0025", "text": "她请我这两天帮她把陈述词顺一遍", "subject": "HER", "relation": "请求", "evidence_uids": [6], "evidence_quotes": ["你这两天帮我顺一遍"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-17 至 2026-11-19", "valid_from": "2026-11-17 21:26", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-17 21:26", "history": []}, "f_0026": {"fact_id": "f_0026", "text": "20 号晚上和小莼做方案板时一并改陈述词", "subject": "SHARED", "relation": "已定安排", "evidence_uids": [6], "evidence_quotes": ["20 号晚上和小莼做板的时候我一并改"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-20 晚上", "valid_from": "2026-11-17 21:26", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-17 21:26", "history": []}, "f_0027": {"fact_id": "f_0027", "text": "这两天帮她顺陈述词（具体哪天未定）", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [6], "evidence_quotes": ["你这两天帮我顺一遍"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "proposed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-17 21:26", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-17 21:26", "history": []}, "f_0028": {"fact_id": "f_0028", "text": "评审通过，排 2 号", "subject": "HER", "relation": "认养评审结果", "evidence_uids": [7], "evidence_quotes": ["过了！排 2 号"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-21", "valid_from": "2026-11-21 13:40", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-21 13:40", "history": []}, "f_0029": {"fact_id": "f_0029", "text": "老桑夸她的方案板实在", "subject": "THIRD", "relation": "评审评价", "evidence_uids": [7], "evidence_quotes": ["老桑夸我方案板实在"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-21", "valid_from": "2026-11-21 13:40", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-21 13:40", "history": []}, "f_0030": {"fact_id": "f_0030", "text": "小莼要请她喝奶茶，说沾喜气", "subject": "THIRD", "relation": "小莼请客", "evidence_uids": [7], "evidence_quotes": ["小莼非要请我喝奶茶，说沾沾喜气"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-21", "valid_from": "2026-11-21 13:40", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-21 13:40", "history": []}, "f_0031": {"fact_id": "f_0031", "text": "闻岁晚下午签了认养协议，当场交了 480 年费，领了地块钥匙牌", "subject": "HER", "relation": "社区花园认养", "evidence_uids": [8], "evidence_quotes": ["下午去把认养协议签了，480 年费当场交了，领了地块的钥匙牌。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-23 下午", "valid_from": "2026-11-23 20:18", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-23 20:18", "history": []}, "f_0032": {"fact_id": "f_0032", "text": "老桑在群里挨个问各家苗几号到，好安排 28 号开垦那天的搬运互助", "subject": "THIRD", "relation": "社区花园", "evidence_uids": [8], "evidence_quotes": ["老桑在群里挨个问：各家苗几号到，他好安排 28 号开垦那天的搬运互助。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-28", "valid_from": "2026-11-23 20:18", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-23 20:18", "history": []}, "f_0033": {"fact_id": "f_0033", "text": "闻岁晚问该怎么向老桑报苗的到货日期", "subject": "HER", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [9], "evidence_quotes": ["他问我苗几号到，我该怎么报？"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-23 20:18", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-23 20:18", "history": []}, "f_0034": {"fact_id": "f_0034", "text": "苗在小莼家放了九天，今早搬到她那边，种球晾得干爽，一棵没蔫", "subject": "HER", "relation": "种植进度", "evidence_uids": [10], "evidence_quotes": ["苗在小莼家放了九天，今早搬过来了，种球晾得干干爽爽，一棵没蔫"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-28", "valid_from": "2026-11-28 18:12", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-28 18:12", "history": []}, "f_0035": {"fact_id": "f_0035", "text": "明天开垦，工具已借好：翻土叉子、耙子各一把，底肥两袋", "subject": "HER", "relation": "开垦准备", "evidence_uids": [10, 11], "evidence_quotes": ["明天开垦，工具我都借好了，翻土的叉子、耙子各一把，底肥两袋", "开垦干完了！翻土下底肥"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "completed", "event_time": "2026-11-29", "valid_from": "2026-11-28 18:12", "valid_to": "2026-11-29 20:37", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-28 18:12", "history": [{"status": "confirmed", "text": "明天开垦，工具已借好：翻土叉子、耙子各一把，底肥两袋", "valid_to": "2026-11-29 20:37", "reason": "complete", "src_uids": [11], "quote": "开垦干完了！翻土下底肥"}]}, "f_0036": {"fact_id": "f_0036", "text": "她今天开垦完成：翻土下底肥，角堇 30 株下地，郁金香种球埋了 20 颗", "subject": "HER", "relation": "种植进度", "evidence_uids": [11], "evidence_quotes": ["开垦干完了！翻土下底肥，角堇 30 株下地，郁金香种球埋了 20 颗"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-29", "valid_from": "2026-11-29 20:37", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-29 20:37", "history": []}, "f_0037": {"fact_id": "f_0037", "text": "老桑说月底发防寒布，第一场霜冻前统一盖", "subject": "THIRD", "relation": "社区花园安排", "evidence_uids": [11], "evidence_quotes": ["老桑说月底发防寒布，第一场霜冻前统一盖"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11 月底", "valid_from": "2026-11-29 20:37", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-29 20:37", "history": []}, "f_0038": {"fact_id": "f_0038", "text": "她认了值日表每周二、周五浇水", "subject": "HER", "relation": "养护排班", "evidence_uids": [11], "evidence_quotes": ["值日表我认了每周二、周五浇水"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "每周二、周五", "valid_from": "2026-11-29 20:37", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-29 20:37", "history": []}, "f_0039": {"fact_id": "f_0039", "text": "防寒布月底发放，具体哪天未定", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [11], "evidence_quotes": ["老桑说月底发防寒布"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "proposed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-29 20:37", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-29 20:37", "history": []}, "f_0040": {"fact_id": "f_0040", "text": "闻岁晚想让蔡叙之在花园邻里茶歇上出一壶热茶，并帮地块拍一组挂牌照", "subject": "HER", "relation": "邀约请求", "evidence_uids": [12], "evidence_quotes": ["我想让你出壶热茶，再帮我给地块拍组挂牌照"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-30 21:05", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-30 21:05", "history": []}, "f_0041": {"fact_id": "f_0041", "text": "老桑在张罗花园邻里茶歇，每户出一样东西，日子还没定", "subject": "THIRD", "relation": "活动筹备", "evidence_uids": [12], "evidence_quotes": ["花园邻里茶歇老桑在张罗，日子一定下来我就喊你，每户出一样东西"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "tentative", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-30 21:05", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-30 21:05", "history": []}, "f_0042": {"fact_id": "f_0042", "text": "花园邻里茶歇的日子未定，定了她再喊蔡叙之", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [12], "evidence_quotes": ["日子一定下来我就喊你"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "proposed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-30 21:05", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-30 21:05", "history": []}}, "fact_seq": 42, "updates": [{"fact_id": "f_0011", "action": "correct", "text": "评审时间已定：2026-11-21 周六上午，每户 8 分钟陈述，加实地看方案板", "old_text": "评审时间未定，等业委会通知", "ts": "2026-11-04 21:07", "src_uids": [1], "quote": "认养评审定在 11 月 21 号周六上午"}, {"fact_id": "f_0018", "action": "complete", "text": "是否让老板先别发货，尚未决定", "old_text": "是否让老板先别发货，尚未决定", "ts": "2026-11-11 21:29", "src_uids": [4], "quote": "苗提前到的事我想好了：19 号到货先放小莼家阳台北角，晒不着，种球摊开晾着就行"}, {"fact_id": "f_0035", "action": "complete", "text": "明天开垦，工具已借好：翻土叉子、耙子各一把，底肥两袋", "old_text": "明天开垦，工具已借好：翻土叉子、耙子各一把，底肥两袋", "ts": "2026-11-29 20:37", "src_uids": [11], "quote": "开垦干完了！翻土下底肥"}]}, "plan_items": [], "seed_fids": {"kbin:me": "f_0001", "kbin:her": "f_0002", "kbin:warmth": "f_0003", "kbin:style": "f_0004", "persona:me": "f_0005", "persona:her": "f_0006"}}